OL,3,AUK lost more than it gained from
OL,4,ABrexit, Burnham says ahead of EU summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has argued the UK
OL,7,Fhas lost more than it has gained from
OL,8,Fleaving the European Union in a speech
OL,9,Fahead of a UK-EU summit later this
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FSpeaking at the Lord Mayor's Banquet on
OL,13,FMonday, Andy Burnham compared the UK's
OL,14,FBrexit deal to the "emperor's new
OL,15,Fclothes" - saying "a needlessly hard
OL,16,FBrexit" created barriers for businesses
OL,17,Fand the promise to "take back control"
OL,18,Fwas not delivered.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
