OL,3,AUK lost more than it gained from
OL,4,ABrexit, Burnham says ahead of EU summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is due to sign new agreements on
OL,7,Ffood, energy and youth mobility with
OL,8,Fthe bloc at Friday's summit, after the
OL,9,Fsubstance of those deals was set by his
OL,10,Fpredecessor Sir Keir Starmer.
OL,12,FThe Conservatives have said Labour are
OL,13,F"dragging us into the European Union
OL,14,Fvia the back door".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
